<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11406] NullPointerException may occur on client start</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11406</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;During testing fixes for&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10878&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10878&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start cluster, create caches with no persistence and load data into it&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Restart each node in cluster by order (coordinator first)&lt;br/&gt;
Do not wait until topology message occurs&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Try to run utilities: activate, baseline (to check that cluster is alive)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Run clients and load data into alive caches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;On 4th step one of the clients throw NPE on start&lt;/p&gt;
